{"server":"tw","storyId":"act25side_level_act25side_04_end","groupId":"act25side","stageId":"act25side_04","title":"一波又起","storyCode":"CW-4","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act25side/level_act25side_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"1dfede5a6365e9c47bae173867bb61b0a12cfb3e42627a54d29c6acfb9a0e90e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"錫人遇襲。博士被陷害。雅拉承受壓力。風劃過赫默的臉頰，她轉過身，她不想再逃了。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g8_alley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......熟悉的下水道的氣味，熟悉的路燈照不到的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些小巷真是每一條都長得差不多啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"整座城市在那麼短的時間內就從荒野上拔地而起，大概做城市規劃的人也想不出那麼多新主意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唯一的問題大概是，走得多了也會想念一些新的風景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說得對吧，我的好部下？從上面俯瞰這座城市的感覺，是不是會好一些？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"空無一人的小巷裡起了一陣風。\n還未來得及吐出去的煙圈全部鑽回了金屬縫隙裡。錫人考慮著自己是否應該合時宜地嗆咳幾聲。\n香煙一頭的火星剛剛熄滅，打火機就已遞到他面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對於這樣一座沒有歷史的城市來說，“缺乏新意”還真是可悲的評價啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......霍爾海雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的聯絡比預定時間晚了三天。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？在我的印象中，您也不是什麼守時的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噪音很大。為什麼選在這裡見面？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您忘了嗎？這裡距離十三區的工廠很近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你找到那天的墜落物了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，可惜只剩下碎片了。星星的......碎片，沒有辦法給迷途之人任何指引。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那克麗斯騰的下落呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在觀察天空？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒有建起高樓的地方，果然能更清晰地看到星空啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您說克麗斯騰會不會躲到某顆星星上去？真要是那樣的話，我們誰都沒有辦法找到她吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......霍爾海雅，你在兩個月前進入了圖書館。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是一名歷史學家，去圖書館難道不是我的本職工作嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是梅蘭德的“圖書館”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不記得自己批准過這次行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您知道的，我總是容易控制不住自己的好奇心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像現在......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上司先生，請容許我......說出一直以來我最好奇的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼問題？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那些煙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了吐出來的部分，進入您身體裡的那幾縷......究竟會鑽去哪裡呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是......你用尾巴尖抵著我胸口的原因嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在您身上......我聞到了我最喜歡的歷史的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果可能的話，我真的很想仔細地......仔細地探究您身上的每一個零件......從哪裡開始比較好呢？您的頭顱，胸膛，還是四肢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......霍爾海雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的認為......背叛梅蘭德基金會是個正確的選擇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梅蘭德掌握了這個國家最多的秘密。而在哥倫比亞，秘密能換取財富......秘密也是殺人的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我花了整整三年的時間，才取得了進入歷史協會的資格，又花了三年時間，取得了您的信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您知道對我而言，六年時間意味著什麼嗎？梅蘭德特工的身份，已經......等同於我七分之一的人生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就更不該在監獄裡或者逃亡路上浪費你的餘生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道......我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而......假如僅剩的時間並不足以讓我擁抱那些夢寐以求的秘密，那能再活十年還是一分鐘，又有什麼差別呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梅蘭德不會容許任何人，尤其是一名叛逃特工觸碰不應觸碰的資訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，你這最後一分鐘，見到的只有我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就只能向星辰祈禱......死人不會輕易開口了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我換一個問題——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——你真的認為，你能殺得了我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不試試看......怎麼知道？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你對空氣的操控不該影響到我......不，這並不是羽蛇的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您對我確實十分瞭解呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過好在......我對您也並非一無所知。尋常的源石技藝，顯然無法影響您的行動，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咒術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是薩卡茲最古老巫術的力量，禁錮靈魂的咒術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的滋味，您是不是很久沒有嘗到過了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當年深入骸骨荒原調查薩卡茲王庭遺跡的時候，我們梅蘭德基金會最出色的特工，史無前例地受了一次危及生命的重傷——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到梅蘭德還留下了這些檔案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您該不會以為，我冒險潛入梅蘭德的絕密資料庫，都是為了克麗斯騰吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我提醒過他，事無巨細地記錄未必在所有場合都是好習慣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖......瞧您說的，只有長生者才能擁有那麼漫長的記憶，其他人想要像您這樣掌握更多知識，自然只能想點別的法子啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"否則的話，那像我們這樣短命的種族，該用什麼方法對抗像您這樣的人的控制呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想破壞這副身軀，你還需要花一點時間吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這兩分鐘的耐心我還是有的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，你甚至不打算出來見我一面嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......女妖？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是強調了自己並不想露面嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過，我對看著你謀殺自己的上司並不感興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，他不止是你的上司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？你們難道是什麼舊相識？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"並不認識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我的血脈知道他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真有趣。我確認過很多次了，這老傢伙身上......可沒有薩卡茲的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心他耍什麼花招。我可不希望好不容易殺掉他，他立刻就原地復活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會讓他干擾接下來的計劃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個陷阱非常精妙。我猜到了霍爾海雅可能在上空做了什麼手腳，卻沒猜到會有人將女妖的咒言藏在工地發出的噪音中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的血脈教會了我詞句的力量，而機械碰撞與摩擦時發出的聲響，是我最常傾聽的語言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"令人驚歎的天賦，就連我都被騙了過去。包括王庭成員在內，很少有女妖能讓我吃這麼大虧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你出生在卡茲戴爾，還是女妖的山谷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的起點無關緊要。我的血統不夠純正，也並未經歷過什麼偉大的事件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今我只是一名工程師，生活在哥倫比亞，做我想做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......哈哈......你在哥倫比亞......找到家園了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......一晃就那麼多年過去了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說，這兩百年間，那兩位年輕人......特雷西斯和特蕾西婭終於把卡茲戴爾建成了移動城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不知道現在的卡茲戴爾是什麼樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"街道是不是還是那麼擁擠，城牆上是不是還披掛著千年前的旗幟，不死不滅的熔爐核心，是不是還是那麼滾燙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"願意再為我點支煙嗎，孩子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一點點火星，留不住魂靈的餘溫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。我只是......還想再多留一會，多問你幾個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在克麗斯騰的夢想中，你看到了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她竟然允諾了你......改變薩卡茲的命運？你相信她能做到這一萬年來都沒人做到的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，她只是讓我看見了一種可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一種......來自我自己的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工程師女士，麻煩問問我的好上司，臨終遺言都交代完了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火快滅了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時間在我這種老傢伙身上走得總是太快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後一個問題，由我提問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來自過去的古老之人，既然你見證過那麼多座卡茲戴爾的毀滅，那你必然也曾思考過，尋覓過——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩卡茲語）哪裡才是薩卡茲的應許之地？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應許......之地啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時間到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"銀綠色的尾巴挾著強風擊碎了錫人的歎息。\n在煙頭落到地面的瞬間，最後一絲火星熄滅了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g7_mainstreet_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"骨哨聲。\n特里蒙的上空從未響起過類似的聲響。無論是在深睡中的居民們，還是依舊在徹夜工作的上班族們，都不會察覺剛剛發生了什麼。\n除了應約而來的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"迷迭香，你剛剛聽到了嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":true,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Logos沒空來特里蒙吧？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我的終端上說，Logos有很多事情要忙。他已經很久沒有陪我練習了，所以我每次訓練都沒有辦法用力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"別為難Mechanist了。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我的裝置和羅德島的船艙一樣，一旦壞了，就需要Mechanist和可露希爾花很多時間調整。"}]},{"label":"煌和Sharp都很不容易。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":true,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":true,"text":"煌和Sharp每次陪我訓練，都會抱怨說比出任務還要累。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":true,"text":"在離開本艦之前，Raidian跟我說，Logos很快就會和阿米婭一起回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我也很想念阿米婭，很想很想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":true,"text":"博士，等我們完成這次任務，回到羅德島，是不是就有可能見到他們了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我也很想他們。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我也希望早點見到他們。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":true,"text":"博士，你是不是到了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是的，訊息裡說的位置就在這條巷子裡。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"錫人應該在等我了吧？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們很快就能回家了，我保證。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g8_alley_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"巷子很深，很黑，很安靜。\n骨碌碌，骨碌碌。有什麼東西從小巷深處的陰影裡滾了出來。\n或許因為太過堅硬，它與地面摩擦的時候，發出的聲音像極了正在空轉的齒輪，還被深夜拉長了回聲，聽起來頗為嚇人。\n它徑直滾到了巷子口，來到了明暗交界的地方。\n原來那是一顆金屬做的腦袋。\n上半邊臉通常會被帽檐擋住一部分，下半邊臉上的嘴巴常常叼著煙，一邊吐著煙圈，一邊說著一些時而銳利時而不著調的話語。\n但現在沒有煙，沒有帽子，也沒有風衣，甚至就連脖子原本該連接著的部分都沒有。\n那僅僅是一顆腦袋。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"錫人......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......死了？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果我是你的話，現在就不會輕舉妄動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟如果你動了的話，我就沒有辦法保證，下一刻你的腦袋會不會去地上陪我可憐的上司。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"有話直說吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你應該不是來同我寒暄的。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩件事——羅德島在特里蒙的到處閒逛之旅該結束了，以及如你所見，梅蘭德特工首領“錫人”之死需要一個兇手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你選中了我。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我該感到榮幸嗎？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的孱弱當然會影響可信度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但羅德島的不起眼與恰到好處的神秘，使得你們足夠成為梅蘭德一段時間內的調查對象。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你想為克麗斯騰爭取時間。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你想為自己爭取時間。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打探更多秘密也不會有什麼好處的哦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我又跑不掉。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是想趁機呼叫幫手嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"低頭看看吧，我的尾巴可不會答應。"}]},{"label":"多瞭解一下彼此總沒有壞處。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想使用最擅長的談判技巧，羅列我有多少條不能對你動手的理由？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只可惜特里蒙並不是提卡倫多，你的對手也不是什麼黑心藥企。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從你進入特里蒙開始，我就在看著你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事原本與你......與羅德島都沒有關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你們和塞雷婭是一路人，總喜歡扮演一些穿梭在火場之中的英雄角色，那為什麼不多派幾個機械師先生一樣的人過來完成任務？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不肯說的話，要不要......我來扯開你的胸膛，看看你的心底裡到底藏著什麼秘密？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"銀綠色的黎博利靠了過來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她的耳羽輕刮著兜帽的布料，發出來的聲音輕柔又刺耳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原本以為你就跟那些神神道道的科學家一樣，想要從克麗斯騰的研究中找到一些關於未來的啟示。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟......我們就是這樣可笑的物種。有限的壽命，無窮的野心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當我們意識到自己短短一生無法追求到更多的時候，甚至願意放下片刻傲慢，去乞求一條捷徑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我在你身上......呼......哈......聞不到欲望的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的夢想是什麼，你的過去又是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，我真的要對你產生興趣了呢，“博士”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，我的同僚們就快到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"捧好你朋友的頭顱，去迎接這個國家最頂尖的特工們一瞬間的驚愕吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上面這些問題，你可以在審訊時再回答我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但願我不會給你這個機會。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會......是你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思？","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘻嘻......誰說戴兜帽的都是同一個人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......水分身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，可憐的精靈，你還會更多招數嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，羅德島的Dr.{@nickname}......我們很快還會再見面的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g7_mainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，很多人都在趕往那個巷口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是梅蘭德的特工。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"羅德島被陷害了。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好你多了個心眼，“借”我的分身去約定地點，不然就真中了那個壞女人的招了哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"她一定還留下了不利於羅德島的證據。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她說的話，你都在通訊器裡聽到了吧？那現在我們豈不是要同時與軍方和梅蘭德為敵了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"恐怕是的。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......哈哈......這真的不是在開玩笑吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你和錫人先生有什麼計劃的話，現在就該說出來了哦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個沉默的意思是......等等，博士，你該不會是說，錫人先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個穿著風衣的鐵罐頭，超級神秘的王牌特工，真的出事了？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我聽到了女妖的骨哨。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"喪鐘已為他而鳴。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是骨哨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你說女妖？是薩卡茲女妖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是為了克麗斯騰嗎？她竟然......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"繆爾賽思突然沉默了。她抬起頭看了看特里蒙的上空。\n除了萬千星辰，那裡什麼都沒有。\n你不禁想起霍爾海雅剛才的問題。\n你為什麼要來到特里蒙？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"克麗斯騰......究竟是個什麼樣的人？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"她正在追逐的夢想，到底是什麼？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g4_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快，赫默，走這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這警報......雅拉主任會不會出事了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默，你沒事吧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還好。塞雷婭......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我幫你扶著她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的臉上都是汗，塞雷婭再不醒的話，我們可能真的會被追上啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不能怪塞雷婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你的臉色......看起來就像你快要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事，伊芙利特。我只是又想起了剛才那一瞬間的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看著她在我面前倒下，我最先感受到的不是擔心，不是驚訝，而是後悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為......你對她生氣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。如果那真的是我對她說的最後一番話，我並不想讓她以為......我在指責她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我從來都沒有......我只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道自己的聲音還能被誰聽見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就和好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那等塞雷婭醒過來，我們一起回去好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等她醒來後，她還是會回來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她就是這樣的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧，我算是知道了，你們兩個都不打算回去，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的話，你們兩個聯手好不好嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聯手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對啊，赫默你雖然換上了新裝備，但是你是醫生嘛，要是遇上像這樣被追著跑的情況，很容易受傷甚至死掉啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷婭雖然很能打，但是本大爺都知道團隊合作的重要性啦，她還是喜歡一個人行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是沒有我們兩個人，塞雷婭現在的處境肯定更危險！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們兩個又都不願意帶上我，那至少要答應我，你會和塞雷婭一起行動才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然的話，你們擔心我，我還擔心你們呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......伊芙利特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就說同意不同意吧，你只要同意，就算你要我乖乖回去找博士也可以！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且只要一起行動的話，有些話就比較容易說出口了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些你都是從哪裡學來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可是博士親傳的交流技巧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我會考慮的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，赫默，那是什麼啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是傳導物質......剛剛掉出來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"銀色的，還會流動，好漂亮啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別碰！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特，這物質......很危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"危險？不會吧，難道比我的火還危險？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也是萊茵實驗的產物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？那我這就燒了它！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，先等等，別急著毀掉它。"},{"type":"narration","text":"小小的一團銀色物質正在試管內部來回衝撞。\n自從離開帕爾維斯的別莊，它就像失去了來自中樞的指令一般，再也沒有表露出渴望奔赴的方向。\n就彷彿它的使命只到領著她找到帕爾維斯為止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師......帕爾維斯從來不做多餘的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他出現在那裡，不可能只是與我閒談......他是故意讓我以為追查傳導物質的終點只有他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"會不會......真相從來都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默，門在這裡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎麼會......我們被發現了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"退後，伊芙利特。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鈣質化......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷婭，你醒了，太好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的身體......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是醫生，這種話騙不了我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g5_rhinelab_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......撐住這扇門，堅持到你們安全離開已經足夠。所以，沒有問題。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"軍方的機甲正在向這個位置靠近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這條路已經不再安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅拉主任......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不會輕易地把情報交出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，只剩下一種可能性。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g1_rhinemeetingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......十分鐘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她們現在應該已經撞上布萊克的人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"換作以前的塞雷婭，或許有機會全身而退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而她受傷不輕，還帶著兩個累贅。你猜猜看，她能在一支全副武裝的特種部隊面前堅持多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的電話響了，女士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。我依然......願意為哥倫比亞服務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......感謝您的忠告。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在你應該願意相信，我確實努力過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我竭盡全力才爭取到了這個溝通的機會。如果你剛剛願意與我達成一致，那我們的前防衛科主任至少沒有生命危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你依然讓她們走上了那條路......那條只有梅蘭德特工才知曉的秘密通道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷婭可能會因你而死，而下一個就可能是你最牽掛的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我發自內心地希望，你能再好好考慮一下那個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克麗斯騰·萊特究竟在哪裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g5_rhinelab_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅拉主任......是梅蘭德的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在十多年前就調查過她，當時一無所獲。直到錫人出現在我面前，我離開萊茵，得到更多線索，才確定了她的身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她在萊茵待了很久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她比我更早認識克麗斯騰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特，攻擊你左手邊的窗戶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它太結實！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實驗區的玻璃都被強化過，普通的衝擊是沒有辦法打碎它的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果直接打碎，動靜也一定會吸引樓下的士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用我的火，來切開這面玻璃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經能控制我的火了，我做得到的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（源石技藝課上，老師說過，火也可以不那麼狂躁，無聲的火，寂靜的憤怒。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（讓我的火變成一把劍。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（讓我的火變成一條線——）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g5_rhinelab_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"裂開了......裂開了一點！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"琺瑯質裂開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷婭，再堅持一下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我完成一半了，我能做到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"集中注意，伊芙利特，不要分心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在你昏迷的時候，雅拉主任對我說，你不可能對抗整個國家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真如你所說，軍方與梅蘭德此時達成了某種協議，那眼下我們面對的就是整個國家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的心率和體溫都瀕臨極限，只是甦醒過來，對你的身體而言都是負擔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷婭，你扛不住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默，我知道你的無人機經過了雅拉女士的改裝。那套方案的設計雛形......我是看過的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你什麼時候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它目前的承重能力至少能帶著兩個成年人完成一次短距離滑翔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從伊芙利特打開的洞出去，無人機能夠帶你們降落在對面大樓的樓頂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"動作要快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等你們過去，我會從這扇門走出去，為你們引開追兵。但敵人的數量非常多，我爭取不了太長時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......塞雷婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還沒有回答我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你做不到真的站在萊茵的對面，是不是因為在骨子裡，你始終和他們......和總轄才是同類？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......對不起，赫默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我認真考慮了，卻無法給你確定的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果克麗斯騰的實驗觸碰了不該動搖的法則，我會阻止她。就像這些年萊茵生命犯過的所有錯誤，都理應得到糾正。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我始終堅信，越是擁有力量的人，就越不該肆意妄為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可如果讓我回到過去，回到我和克麗斯騰初識，一切都還沒有發生的時刻......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會阻止當時的克麗斯騰，我不會阻止萊茵生命的誕生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，即便我知道萊茵未來會製造如此之多的災難，即便我預測到克麗斯騰、帕爾維斯和斐爾迪南的野心會生長到失控的地步——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我依然會和他們站在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷婭......或許你的答案比你自己想像的更確定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默，塞雷婭！你們看到了嗎？我打開了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，赫默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你還想知道什麼事情，等解決這件事之後，我都會告訴你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默，赫默？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在發什麼呆，我們該走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“這些事情和你沒有關係，可憐的黎博利。”\n“你想要得到的，是真相、正義，還是安寧？”\n“我會告訴你你想要知道的東西。”\n“然而知道這些之後，你又能做些什麼呢？”\n這不是我想要的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無人機......的綁帶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默，你這是在做什麼？！"},{"type":"narration","text":"身後傳來無人機啟動的聲響。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沒了琺瑯質的包裹，走廊盡頭的門在能量武器的衝擊下即將破損。\n半空中的塞雷婭一隻手拉住了伊芙利特，又伸出另一隻手，想要抓住赫默。\n然而赫默沒有回握她的手，而是沿著來時的路，一步一步地後退。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我應該早一點和你聊一聊的，塞雷婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在剛才突然明白，為什麼我常常忍不住對你生氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為是“炎魔事件”的餘波在作祟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者是我不滿於你那種總是想要一個人扛下所有的作風。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但其實......我真正惱火的對象是我自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會責怪你做得還不夠好，只是因為......我習慣性地在依賴著你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望你能改變總轄，就像我曾希望老師能拯救伊芙利特，總轄能改變萊茵......我希望所有的癥結都能被更強大的人們解決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是真的很軟弱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一方面痛恨著那些操縱一切，將無辜者的生命視作耗材與數字的強者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一方面卻依舊將自己對未來的期盼寄託於另一批強者的道德與同理心上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到這一刻，當事情完全超出個體的能力範圍時，我才明白，沒有人能真正替別人扛下所有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一路上，所有願意幫助我的人，羅德島，繆爾賽思主任，雅拉主任，你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們都希望我能夠置身事外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你不曾在我面前倒下，如果伊芙利特不曾遭遇危險，或許我真的會乖乖放棄吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在——我不願意退讓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我無法再容忍自己待在你的羽翼之下。我無法接受自己只能在炮火來臨時，徒勞地站在那些受損害的人面前張開雙臂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一次，我會先你們一步走進戰火裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g13_trimountlivingroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"無人機準確地將兩人送到了隔壁大樓稍低的樓層外，塞雷婭擊碎窗戶，兩人順利降落。\n雖然樓下必然還有斐爾迪南的人在看守，但是，只要有行動的餘地，她相信自己可以找到突破包圍的辦法。\n只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默......在幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默，你快點用無人機飛過來呀！"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊芙利特焦急地向著對面的房間呼喊，然而，赫默在深深地看了她們一眼後，背過身去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在赫默背過身去的那一瞬間，塞雷婭看到了赫默的眼神。\n那眼神中飽含著歉意。\n但更多的，是堅決。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g1_rhinemeetingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斐爾迪南，我們在走廊上發現了一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她說她有事情要找你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......赫默？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，雅拉主任。我已經決定了。我有沒完成的事，還不能離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得你，帕爾維斯的好學生。在359號基地的時候，你和埃琳娜一起，給我添了不少麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的，我叫赫默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想來跟你做一場交易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交易？你該不會是想讓我放過塞雷婭吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是由你決定的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，唯獨這件事，我可以做決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你拿的是......359號基地的傳導物質。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你幹什麼？！就算你讓傳導物質進入體內，也起不到任何作用，多蘿西的“中樞”已經毀了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新的“中樞”就在克麗斯騰手裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不可能。那是我的實驗，我和多蘿西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不久之前，我見到了帕爾維斯老師。他的實驗室裡儲存著大量的傳導物質。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克魯尼主任，你其實早就猜到了，你只是不願意承認......你寧可相信自己的失敗是棋差一著，也不願意相信，你從頭到尾都被總轄耍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你難道沒有想過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明她才是那個和軍方合作更為緊密的人，她有無數種方法提前將你與多蘿西的實驗扼殺於雛形——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——為什麼，她偏偏在你們的實驗成功後才出現？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還有機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論克麗斯騰想利用傳導物質做什麼，她都還沒有成功。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克魯尼主任，帶我去找她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傳導物質在我的體內，我會成為你們尋找克麗斯騰的路標。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
